  "details": "There is at least two meanings of word \"Blocked\" in UI:\n\n- Blocked Users (can be found at least in MM, plural)\n\n- Blocked Avatar (can be found on nameplate, non-plural)\n\nIt seems, this is only instance of word \"Blocked\" on Crowdin, so it probably also used somewhere else. It may also be necessary to split those for plural and non-plural forms for each context, but we not 100% sure yet where this string might used in another places.",
